Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.659
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:02.581
(thud)

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:03.560
(thud)

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.639
